- spec file cleanup
- version 5.1.12
   * load balance enforcement has been improved for parallel graph
     partitioning
   * The clustering features of Scotch and PT-Scotch are now
     available through the '-q' option of command line programs
     dgmap, dgpart, gmap and gpart.
